{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/血性","pageid":7414,"revid":17867,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%A1%80%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%A1%80%E6%80%A7&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%A1%80%E6%80%A7&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>血性</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E8.A1.80.E6.80.A7\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"血性\"><b>血性</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"技能 血性.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/94/i05uy3rtfmksf0jydz8r02h8yfltqtz.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E8%A1%80%E6%80%A7.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/94/i05uy3rtfmksf0jydz8r02h8yfltqtz.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E8%A1%80%E6%80%A7.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/94/i05uy3rtfmksf0jydz8r02h8yfltqtz.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />血性\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[被动]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（被动）战斗开始时，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">血性</span>]，效果：<br />✦主动攻击时，物攻提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>；普攻时，物攻额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"蛮熊形态\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">蛮熊形态</font></span></span>]时，获得额外技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">暴怒吼</font></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%98%BF%E5%88%97%E5%85%8B%E8%B0%A2%E2%80%A2%E9%A3%8E%E9%9B%AA%E5%AD%A4%E8%A1%8C\" title=\"角色图鉴库/阿列克谢•风雪孤行\"><img alt=\"头像 阿列克谢•风雪孤行.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e7/p3uev98o9wqyvt0sj9v59pw1twf9swg.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">阿列克谢•风雪孤行</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-a